<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"/>
  <title>Driver Approval Confirmation</title>
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: 'Arial', sans-serif;
      background-color: #f6f6f6;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 20px;
    }
    .email-container {
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: auto;
      background-color: #ffffff;
      padding: 30px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      box-shadow: 0 2px 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
    }
    h1 {
      color: #27ae60;
    }
    p {
      color: #333333;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }
    .btn {
      display: inline-block;
      margin-top: 20px;
      padding: 10px 20px;
      background-color: #27ae60;
      color: #ffffff;
      text-decoration: none;
      border-radius: 4px;
    }
    .footer {
      margin-top: 30px;
      font-size: 12px;
      color: #888888;
      text-align: center;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="email-container">
    <h1>🎉 Congratulations, <%= name %>!</h1>
    <p>
      Your application to become a driver on <strong>TripSync</strong> has been approved.
    </p>
    <p>
      You can now log in to your account, set your availability status, and start accepting ride requests.
    </p>
    <p class="footer">
      If you have any questions or need help, feel free to contact our support team.
      <br/>— The TripSync Team
    </p>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
